---
# Purpose
The single public answer source for greatVibe plans, prices, trial, billing,
hosted-node pricing and Mochi limits. Agents quote prices only from here.

# Sources
- The live greatvibe.ai Pricing section and Terms (wording mirrored; quoted
  lines are verbatim).
- Shipped product behaviour for Mochi limits and the Add Node quote.

# Key Sections
- At a glance · Self-serve plan · Trial · Billing and cancellation · Tax and
  currency · Hosted nodes · Mochi · Enterprise · Data and AI costs · Rules for
  agents · Agent IQ Web block · What this guide does not cover.

# Gotchas
- Guests in Mochi sign up inside the console (turns panel Sign up, or Guest
  menu > Sign in or register). Never send guests to the website to sign up.
- Choice values greatvibe:signup / greatvibe:login are handled by the guest
  console (open the account dialog, no turn used). Keep them exact.
- Publish only what the live website says or what users can see in the
  product today. No Enterprise bands, discounts, add-on prices, node price
  lists, internal costs, roadmap items or features still in design.
- Keep seat-change wording to what this guide says; do not add billing
  mechanics the website does not state.
- When the website pricing or Terms change, update this guide in the same week.
- Brand wordmark is "greatVibe"; the primary CTA is "Try greatVibe".

# Change History
- 2026-10-13: Guests sign up inside the console. New agent rule 9 (Web
  block + ask, with greatvibe:signup choice) and a signup row in the Web
  block, at the product owner's request.
- 2026-10-12: Created from the live website pricing and Terms, at the product
  owner's request. SANITIZATION.md allows published list prices here only.
- 2026-10-20: Mochi limits: one turn up to 15 minutes (live since 0.6.359) and idle end after 30 minutes (0.6.360, guests and members), at the product owner's request.
